  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-46004" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subregional Transport Enhancement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed loan and grant (the Project) will improve the country&apos;s road network totaling about 217.3 km, (i) providing north-south link of the country&apos;s north eastern region to the east-west highway (EWH); and (ii) improving major international trade corridors in the country in conjunction with customs systems enhancement. The capacity of the road sector and customs institutions will also be strengthened. The project will expand connectivity with remote areas and enhance the capacity of major international trade corridors to develop the economy of project areas as well as integrate those more effectively with their primary markets in India, and further to third countries, by enhancing the capacity of roads and customs clearance.</narrative>
  </description>
